<title>ITALY: Italy records bop deficit in November.</title>
<headline>Italy records bop deficit in November.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's overall balance of payments recorded a 4.176 trillion lire deficit in November, the Italian Foreign Exchange Office said.</p>
<p>BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (In billions of lire)</p>
<p>			     Nov 96	 Oct 96    Nov 95</p>
<p> Total			-4,176	 +3,483   -2,945</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  +23,570	+27,363   -2,890</p>
<p> Capital movements	-7,212	   +928   -3,439</p>
<p>  -Year to date	   -7,196	 -2,342   -5,655</p>
</text>
